	(text "RADIO – Ebyte E01-ML01SP4 (nRF24L01P + PA/LNA, 2.4 GHz)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "077c7ce9-e30f-5e77-bebd-1c48da6b6717")
	)
	(text "DRAFT – for ET review.\nVCC 2.0–3.6 V, ABS. MAX 3.6 V (manual §2.1): only 3V3_RADIO from the TLV75533 LDO on the power sheet,\nnever the cell (4.2 V) and never the Pi's 3V3 (shared with the SoC, TX bursts of 120 mA).\nLayout (manual §4.1): GND pour under the module on both layers, stitched; no top-layer tracks under it;\nkeep it away from the boost converter and its inductor (far corner of the HAT); IPEX end toward the board edge.\nAntenna: Ebyte TX2400-FPC-2509 flex, off-board on a box wall, on the module's IPEX (U.FL);\nglue the U.FL plug (drop test)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4a94523a-fa16-5c0d-b103-57339315ddaf")
	)
	(text "MODULE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "57b5e3aa-4f8d-5f5d-ab76-d8a87f3b5b71")
	)
	(text "Pads 9/10 = GND half-holes on the long edges\n(hidden, stacked on pin 8). CE also enables\nthe LNA (manual §4.2): driven by GPIO 22,\nwhose boot default pull-down keeps the\nradio idle until the driver starts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c969366c-dc3c-5a2d-9790-f1b5732c0282")
	)
	(text "DECOUPLING AT PAD 1 (110 µF total; TLV75533 allows 1–200 µF)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f1e92a25-3c08-542d-b42d-dd9243acb907")
	)
	(text "Place all three at pad 1, smallest closest. C70 rides the 120 mA TX bursts\n(PA on) so the LDO's load step does not dip VCC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cebe15ef-320c-5d1e-94b2-e02e12d490da")
	)
	(text "SPI SOURCE TERMINATION (33 Ω)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8968db0e-5803-5308-aa00-760372fce685")
	)
	(text "R82 SCK, R83 MOSI: at the Pi end (header J1, drivers = Pi).\nR84 MISO: at the radio end (driver = SP4 pad 6).\nSource termination of the 30–40 mm lines: cheap ringing control,\n0 Ω if the bench shows no need (spidev runs at ≤ 8 MHz)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce683e31-a3c5-5803-a4bb-a99028af531f")
	)
	(text "PULL-UPS TO 3V3_PI"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9dac23ad-7498-5373-91d1-7bd6fb016e86")
	)
	(text "R80: CSN high = radio deselected while the Pi boots (GPIO 8 is an input\nwith its default pull-up until spidev takes it).\nR81: IRQ idle level while the SP4 is unpowered or in reset; harmless otherwise.\nBoth rails come from VBAT_SW together (boost → Pi, LDO → radio): no back-feed of the Pi."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "244b07a4-719e-5c0c-8f80-7da3ac1a3b52")
	)
	(text "TEST POINT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f845ea11-28be-5494-8157-62c7cb996724")
	)
	(text "At the module: T0 checks VCC under TX bursts (3.6/3.3/3.0 V cell)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5ec6a524-ae73-5735-8c36-2e5c747d79dd")
	)
